    "{imported} posts written with {media} of their pictures; {already} were already here, {skipped} were not posts to bring over, {failed} could not be written." : "{imported} innlegg skrevet med {media} av bildene deres; {already} var allerede her, {skipped} var ikke innlegg å bringe over, {failed} kunne ikke skrives.",
    "The run stopped at its limit — import the same file again to carry on." : "Kjøringen stoppet ved grensen - importer den samme filen igjen for å fortsette.",
