    "Both windows are the same length, so the pair is worth reading. A post counts on the day it went out, together with everything it has collected since." : "Begge vinduene er like lange, så paret er verdt å lese. Et innlegg teller dagen det gikk ut, sammen med alt det har samlet siden.",
